*setenv* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''setenv(name, value)''

Sets an environment variable.

*Parameters:*
- ''name'': String environment variable name
- ''value'': String value to set

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if name is not a string
- Runtime error if value is not a string
- Runtime error if setting environment variable fails
